measure exactly 9 minutes with 4 and 7 minute glasses
say flip 4, flip 7, flip both, wait, done, hint or quit
the clock starts now, with both glasses run out

0 minutes gone; sand left to fall: 0 in the 4, 0 in the 7
> hint
from here: flip both, wait, flip 4, wait, flip 7, wait, flip 7, wait, done

0 minutes gone; sand left to fall: 0 in the 4, 0 in the 7
> flip both

0 minutes gone; sand left to fall: 4 in the 4, 7 in the 7
> wait

4 minutes gone; sand left to fall: 0 in the 4, 3 in the 7
> flip 4

4 minutes gone; sand left to fall: 4 in the 4, 3 in the 7
> wait

7 minutes gone; sand left to fall: 1 in the 4, 0 in the 7
> done
that is 7 minutes, not 9

7 minutes gone; sand left to fall: 1 in the 4, 0 in the 7
> flip 7

7 minutes gone; sand left to fall: 1 in the 4, 7 in the 7
> wait

8 minutes gone; sand left to fall: 0 in the 4, 6 in the 7
> flip 7

8 minutes gone; sand left to fall: 0 in the 4, 1 in the 7
> wait

9 minutes gone; sand left to fall: 0 in the 4, 0 in the 7
> done
that is 9 minutes exactly
